        "The saved check intentionally fails; maintenance remains an annotation, not success or suppression.",
        "A local-file delivery does not prove human receipt, acknowledgment, incident resolution or task success.",
        "Finite foreground example only; no unattended recurring installation or supervisor-loss guarantee.",
        "No independent Pulse support or automatic cross-source legitimacy is established.",
        "Interruption and delivery uncertainty controls are separately component-qualified; the example does not inject an end-to-end interrupted delivery.",
